    proposedMitigations: `Provide evidence that demonstrates a robust process by which to attempt to predict and/or detect minor but impactful changes that have been made to the underlying, remote LLM. These could include but are not limited to: embedding notification requirements in service contracts to force LLM providers to give direct notice of changes; actively monitoring information released publicly by the LLM provider and/or establishing a robust but efficient regression pack which is regularly run on the front-end product and which will detect any significant / relevant changes in the behaviour of the underlying, remote LLM. Finally, provide evidence that documents contingency plans by which to deal with changes that cannot be accommodated by the front-end product.`,
